Zelenskiy says a medical facility was hit
in the central Ukrainian city of Dnipro.

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:31.291
16 people are reported injured including
a six year old and a three year old.

00:01:31.624 --> 00:01:34.394
Military officials say the they downed

00:01:34.394 --> 00:01:37.997
most of Russia's 17
cruise missiles and 31 attack drones.

00:01:38.031 --> 00:01:41.301
Meanwhile, in Russia, a large explosion
was heard overnight in the city

00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:45.405
of Cranston DA
and a building was damaged there.

00:01:45.438 --> 00:01:48.408
The governor of Belgorod
is also reporting shelling.

00:01:48.408 --> 00:01:49.976
He says four homes were damaged.

00:01:49.976 --> 00:01:52.312
There were no casualties
reported so far from that.

00:01:52.345 --> 00:01:53.646
Let's go to Sam Kiley.

00:01:53.646 --> 00:01:55.381
He's live in eastern Ukraine with more.

00:01:55.381 --> 00:01:57.484
Sam, what can you tell
us, especially those children

00:02:01.054 --> 00:02:01.554
Well, once

00:02:01.554 --> 00:02:05.592
again, a large city like Disney
Pro has been hit at the moment.

00:02:05.592 --> 00:02:09.662
The casualty figures lower
than some of the more atrocious strikes

00:02:09.662 --> 00:02:12.765
which have been directed at
or at least fallen upon

00:02:13.066 --> 00:02:15.835
residential buildings,
particularly in Disney Pro.

00:02:16.402 --> 00:02:19.806
This one, as you say, he's got 16 wounded.

00:02:20.106 --> 00:02:21.841
There are four people missing.

00:02:21.841 --> 00:02:25.778
One confirmed dead in this missile strike,
which Ukraine's

00:02:25.778 --> 00:02:29.816
first lady has described as a cynical act.

00:02:30.049 --> 00:02:33.153
To be honest,
the fact of the matter is that

00:02:33.887 --> 00:02:38.258
the Russians are profligate
in their attacks across civilian areas.

00:02:38.358 --> 00:02:39.325
Right across the country.

00:02:39.325 --> 00:02:42.829
Sometimes their aim,
sometimes they're simply firing

00:02:43.329 --> 00:02:46.232
into the landscape more generally
with the hope of hitting something.

00:02:46.232 --> 00:02:49.435
This may well be a fall into that latter
category.

00:02:49.435 --> 00:02:53.806
But at the same time,
the Ukrainians continue to try to rattle

00:02:54.207 --> 00:02:57.043
the Russians behind the border.

00:02:57.143 --> 00:03:02.849
Now, with Russia, with reportedly more
shelling from Ukraine into border areas,

00:03:03.082 --> 00:03:06.586
