that has come in for months now

00:03:06.753 --> 00:03:08.988
from day
one of the war from those border areas

00:03:08.988 --> 00:03:12.825
into Ukraine along the northern border,
particularly in Belgorod Province.

00:03:12.825 --> 00:03:14.827
And then we've got this mysterious

00:03:14.827 --> 00:03:19.566
explosion or fire much deeper into Russia
with no confirmation

00:03:19.566 --> 00:03:23.269
from either side really
as to what has been the cause of that.

00:03:23.269 --> 00:03:26.472
But all of this part of a pattern
really in which

00:03:26.472 --> 00:03:29.475
the Russians continued to hit
civilian targets inside Ukraine

00:03:29.776 --> 00:03:33.079
while the Ukrainians is continuing
to try to destabilize the Russia

00:03:33.279 --> 00:03:36.783
as part ultimately of the early stages
of a summer offensive.

00:03:37.517 --> 00:03:40.353
Sam Kiley in eastern Ukraine,
appreciate your reporting.

00:03:40.386 --> 00:03:41.287
Thank you.

00:03:41.487 --> 00:03:42.422
